<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - D.R. Horton cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - D.R. Horton cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had cut its rating for D.R. Horton Inc to near-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept its rating of long-term accumulate for the Arlington, Texas, home builder.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company fell 2-3/8 to 9-1/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
